Created by [[Jack Kirby]], ''Darkseid'' first appeared as a cameo appearance in {{c|Superman's Pal, Jimmy Olsen #134}} ([[1970]]). He then made his first full appearance in {{c|Forever People #1}} ([[1971]]).
